  "description": "Taenyeo has always been curious about sex but has never had the chance to experience it firsthand. Then, out of the blue, she meets a drop-dead gorgeous man she’s never seen before who insists they're married. To her surprise, he's eager to get to know her...starting with a very physical approach. Intrigued, Taenyeo decides to go with the flow, but things get complicated when another classmate catches her eye. He's equally stunning, with intense eyes and a perfect physique. Torn between two equally attractive men, Taenyeo faces the dilemma of choosing one...but why not try them both before making a decision?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
